## 2026-09-24T21:45:00Z session — Statbel's REFNIS download returns a bot-challenge page, not the file
curl https://statbel.fgov.be/sites/default/files/files/opendata/REFNIS%20code/TU_COM_REFNIS.zip → 200 text/html (TSPD challenge); unzip: End-of-central-directory signature not found
headless Chromium: page.goto: net::ERR_CERT_AUTHORITY_INVALID; with request routing the TSPD challenge never resolved
- resolved: The REFNIS codes are read from Eurostat's LAU list for Belgium (the same codes, as of 2024) plus the 2025 mergers' codes listed in scripts/communes/generate.py; the generator fails on any bpost commune it cannot place.
- rule: statbel.fgov.be downloads sit behind a JavaScript bot challenge; a script cannot fetch them. Take Belgian REFNIS codes from Eurostat's LAU file and check new codes by hand on Statbel.

